<title>JAPAN: Fuji Heavy shares up on expected solid earnings.</title>
<headline>Fuji Heavy shares up on expected solid earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Fuji Heavy Industries Ltd rose in heavy trading on Friday morning, helped by expectations that the car maker will post solid earnings for the financial year to March, 1997.</p>
<p>As of 0129 GMT, the share price was up 20 yen at 535 yen. Volume was 2.719 million shares, the ninth heaviest on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
